{"id":88072953439343,"type":"album","name":"Heart of the Congos","artist":"The Congos","year":1977,"weight":18,"info":{"cover":"https://ia600309.us.archive.org/16/items/mbid-1d458969-54cc-48a9-b10c-7da39fd999cc/mbid-1d458969-54cc-48a9-b10c-7da39fd999cc-8215434243.jpg","yt":"chUlpS_8W5A","desc":"Lee Perry is generally acknowledged as a production genius, but on occasion that genius can be destructive, and while there's no disputing his talent, sometimes the results can be less than aurally satisfying. This is especially true when it comes to albums, where Perry's efforts were often erratic. On Heart of the Congos he was brilliant, and across the record's original ten tracks Perry created a masterpiece of music. Many critics consider this 1977 album one of the best roots records of all time, and at the very least, it was Perry's apex -- only Junior Byles' Beat Down Babylon ."},"artist_ref":{"id":51765097776573,"name":"The Congos","info":{"img":null}},"labels":[],"genres":[{"id":10697304889908,"type":"genre","name":"Reggae","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":615,"yt":null,"src":"musthear,rym"},{"id":75119490241680,"type":"genre","name":"Dub","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":346,"yt":null,"src":"musthear"},{"id":60739696558265,"type":"genre","name":"Roots Reggae","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":216,"yt":null,"src":"musthear,rym"},{"id":38301219112868,"type":"genre","name":"Jamaican Music","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":214,"yt":null,"src":"rym"},{"id":108602678753395,"type":"genre","name":"Caribbean Music","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":208,"yt":null,"src":"rym"}],"lists":[{"id":138325613739201,"name":"RYM Top — Reggae / Ska / Dancehall — Roots Reggae","src":"musthear","grp":"rateyourmusic","list_year":null,"rank":2,"year":null,"note":null,"total":200,"scaruffi":null},{"id":595162033579,"name":"RYM Top — Regional Music — Jamaican Music","src":"musthear","grp":"rateyourmusic","list_year":null,"rank":3,"year":null,"note":null,"total":200,"scaruffi":null},{"id